# employee_mgmt.func

> Module: employee_mgmt (Personel Yönetimi) | Category: HR

## Purpose
Employee/driver personnel management. Track all staff with contact info, roles, and Turkish-required certifications (driver's license expiry, SRC certificate validity).

## Problems It Solves
- Logistics companies employ drivers, office staff, and accountants
- Turkish law requires commercial drivers to have valid SRC (Professional Competence) certificates
- Driver license (ehliyet) expiry tracking — legal requirement
- Phone contact list for dispatch operations
- Link employees to trips, driver leave, and fuel/maintenance records

## Technical Database Structure
**Table:** `employees`
| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | SERIAL PK | Unique identifier |
| tenant_id | INTEGER FK | Tenant isolation |
| ad_soyad | VARCHAR(200) | Full name |
| rol | employee_rol_enum | Role (SOFOR, OFIS, MUHASEBE, DIGER) |
| telefon | VARCHAR(20) | Phone |
| email | VARCHAR(200) | Email |
| ehliyet_sinifi | VARCHAR(10) | License class (C, CE, D, DE) |
| ehliyet_bitis | DATE | License expiry |
| src_bitis | DATE | SRC certificate expiry |
| aktif | BOOLEAN | Active status |
| created_at, updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | Timestamps |

**Enum:** `employee_rol_enum` — SOFOR, OFIS, MUHASEBE, DIGER

## User Interface
**EmployeesPage.tsx** — `/dashboard/employees`
- DataGrid table: Ad Soyad, Rol, Telefon, Email, Ehliyet, SRC
- Add/Edit modal: name, role dropdown, phone, email, license info
- Expiry date highlights (red if expired, yellow if within 30 days)
- Employee metrics: trip count, total revenue generated
- Export to CSV/Excel/PDF

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|--------|------|:---:|-------------|
| GET | `/api/tenant/employees/` | Tenant JWT | List employees |
| GET | `/api/tenant/employees/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Detail + metrics |
| POST | `/api/tenant/employees/` | Tenant JWT | Add employee |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/employees/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Edit employee |
| DELETE | `/api/tenant/employees/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Remove employee |

## Known Bugs
- Early bug (B3, fixed May 25): empty date strings for ehliyet_bitis/src_bitis caused 500
- All known bugs fixed

